# MUSA

**MUSA — AI-Powered Search Engine**

MUSA is a command-line search engine being built from the ground up using
Python.

The project aims to combine:

- Web crawling
- Full-text information retrieval
- BM25 ranking
- Semantic search
- Hybrid retrieval
- Search result ranking
- LLM-powered question answering
- Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)
- Source citations
- Search evaluation

## Current Status

🚧 Early development

Current features:

- CLI interface
- Search command
- Index statistics command
- Automated CLI tests

## Planned Architecture

```text
User
 ↓
CLI
 ↓
Query Processing
 ↓
Search Engine
 ├── Lexical Retrieval
 ├── Semantic Retrieval
 └── Ranking
 ↓
Relevant Documents
 ↓
LLM
 ↓
Cited Answer
```
